6-10-18T15:46:31Z","role":"primary","sha256":"5559391b26a6541363ea50de16b1c91b3958c18b2668020ccd5daff3b33e5626","supports":["licenses.data"],"url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Bofeee5675/GUI-Net-Mini/raw/7c1ed0cd8fea76d5eba868114d2d6374d4370a12/README.md"}],"id":"url:0627940da1b988739f75","identifiers":{},"kind":"dataset","last_verified_at":"2026-10-18T15:46:31Z","licenses":{"code":null,"data":{"basis":"publisher model/dataset card metadata; third-party assets retain their own terms","declared":"apache-2.0","retrieved_at":"2026-10-18T15:46:31Z","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Bofeee5675/GUI-Net-Mini/raw/7c1ed0cd8fea76d5eba868114d2d6374d4370a12/README.md"},"document":null,"weights":null},"links":[{"rel":"primary","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Bofeee5675/GUI-Net-Mini"}],"name":"GUI-Net-Mini","notes":"The card is titled TongUI-143K. The TongUI training docs list this repository beside GUI-Net-1M as 143k TongUI-collected samples plus about 240k from previous work, used for scaling experiments, and their default 3B configuration, which they say reproduces the paper's results, names 13 datasets whose dataset_info.json files are exactly this repository's 13 annotation files. A streaming script over those files counts 143,856 records in the three TongUI-collected files (WikiHow, Baidu Experience, GUI video) and 379,517 in the ten files reprocessed from AITW, AMEX, GUIAct, Mind2Web, MiniWoB and ShowUI; the card's 237K 'Other' figure matches the 237,564 records in eight of those ten, leaving out the AMEX element and ShowUI web grounding files (141,953 records). Records are LLaMA-Factory conversations: coordinate-prediction grounding turns, or navigation steps with a thought and a JSON action in a smartphone, computer or website action space depending on the file. Screenshots come as 24 split ZIP parts (about 254 GB in the manifest) that were not downloaded. Apache-2.0 is the card's declaration; the reprocessed datasets and the tutorial and video content keep their own terms.","published_at":null,"relations":[{"evidence_url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Bofeee5675/GUI-Net-Mini/raw/7c1ed0cd8fea76d5eba868114d2d6374d4370a12/README.md","target_id":"arxiv:2504.12679","type":"documented_by"}],"review_status":"curated","scope":"core","summary":"TongUI training mixture: about 143K samples from WikiHow, Baidu Experience and GUI videos plus reprocessed AITW, AMEX, GUIAct, Mind2Web, MiniWoB and ShowUI data, as grounding and navigation JSON with screenshots.","task_classes":["R01.11.01.01","R04.01.02.04"],"topics":["data-generation","grounding","imitation-learning"],"updated_at":null,"url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/Bofeee5675/GUI-Net-Mini"}
